Package: factomics
Title: Multi-Omics Factor Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Author", "Bernard Isekah Osang'ir", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bernard.osangir@sckcen.be")
Description: A unified framework for multi-omics latent factor analysis.
    Supports FABIA, MOFA2, GFA, and MFA methods with a single consistent
    interface. Provides tools to run individual or multiple methods,
    compare and benchmark results, merge factor scores with metadata,
    and produce publication-ready visualizations.
